{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"48812af8a5558c0fa46d3aefc88739572d26fadbcb9e43218ed369b8cb423fb6","ja":"キャンペーン開始","zh":"活动开始","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"51e94cc7c9282ee22edd136a5d20f392be57695a5262b64406c395d73e72781e","ja":"次の日、ショッピングモールで……","zh":"第二天，在商场……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cbd8b80c45a3a9683445703588154e1cff0f5a820280560512328e2c7eece7ad","ja":"えへへっ……♪\nつい……いっぱい買い物、しちゃいました。","zh":"嘿嘿……♪\n不知不觉……就买了一大堆东西。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b66c0b6bce2dd9ad086aa9c9937dafba17125001590e602cd9173a6bf9e147f7","ja":"可憐、荷物半分持つよ。\nなんだか重そうだから。","zh":"可怜，我来帮你拿一半行李吧。\n看起来挺沉的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"327495635a00a0a6da0cf586c5a6e7aa2d7b7f27126231a91617f19bef4b7b14","ja":"ええっ！？　荷物を持ってくれるのか！？\n紗代子、すっげー優しいな！！","zh":"诶！？帮我拿行李吗！？\n纱代子，你也太温柔了吧！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"10673a3ee6cc64f169f6e0e9192251f76e48b1848c6192e6a4c967ceee299241","ja":"す、昴ちゃん？　声が大きいよ。\nみんなびっくりしてこっちを見てるって……。","zh":"昂、小昂？声音太大了啦。\n大家都被吓到，全往这边看了啦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a24c63b4094b1f1d42a665abda1b29c7162d47c8fa416df299aa74f339fe5256","ja":"それなら、大成功だな！　実はこれ、\n『紗代子はいい人キャンペーン』の一貫なんだ！","zh":"那样的话，就算大成功啦！其实这可是\n“纱代子是个好人活动”的一环呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b916565f92d09c339b917de34b81ae25a47c346710537d3d535447e4c1884aac","ja":"えっ、私がいい人のキャンペーン……？","zh":"诶，我是好人的活动……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"332f4270d2e454c6f9e7e3376601e8e1c60c035baa1b73362b6e62c494586ef5","ja":"そうそう！　ほら、藍役のイメージがついて、\n怖がられちゃってるって話だったろ？","zh":"对对！你看，之前不是说因为蓝这个角色的印象太深，\n结果大家都觉得你很可怕吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0d2b6463df44174dfedfe5f56348ca026da456690a055f668148ddc59ab6852d","ja":"だからこうやって、\n紗代子はいい人なんだって、アピールするんだ！","zh":"所以才要像这样，\n宣传纱代子是个大好人啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3deb1eaecbd35ba93d65a9c6babe08b0315923c3e08064c0cb6ec477fbad6d82","ja":"な、なるほど……！　それじゃあ、みんなで\n『いい人キャンペーン』をしたら……！","zh":"原、原来如此……！那么大家要是\n一起来办『好人宣传活动』的话……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a915a5b4b39f92bec1ae1468bdba41e7d391b6f808383501ea810fb1910b4e9e","ja":"また次の日、ライブ中のMCで……","zh":"到了第二天，在演出的MC环节中……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"dc146ab56fc1d6bae3f2410bd0d28a4c6ae47db2608dd78084edbe842e6e9335","ja":"紗代子は、自分のレッスンが終わった後も、\nわたくしのレッスンに付き合ってくださいましたのよ。","zh":"纱代子在自己的练习结束之后，\n还特意陪我一起练习了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"7fdfff3a58c414fbf4c5b86fd2801f245f82b8213ad5c991363d789202c37878","ja":"紗代子ちゃんは、ありさのこともいつも\n助けてくれるんですよ！　そう、あれは大雨の日……。","zh":"纱代子也总是会帮亚利沙的忙哦！\n没错，那是一个下大雨的日子……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"bde1181a1ca73d2dc7777b7c4c47d400fad2bcc4356cb68e6c61eda8a452797e","ja":"ふ、ふたりともありがとう！\nでも、恥かしいから……。","zh":"两、两个人都谢谢你们！\n不过，好害羞啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"5fd0c6feab7b933ba4723a4b408664b0f5fcaa754c5db8bde74fff54be6d0d5d","ja":"そして控室でも……","zh":"而在休息室里也……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"85dc0ca859f21200cc47aeb3ee4470c6f08d43f967cde5dbc6ac9f8d061249f1","ja":"紗代子っていいやつだよな～。\n仕事の前とか、いつも励ましてくれるし！","zh":"纱代子真是个好家伙啊～。\n工作之前什么的，总会给我鼓励！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"e88f56b1e65a309b8e18336f1fb6ab07a0f5f7c15b3710306fa2bbf6e77e9267","ja":"わかります～！\nありさも、一緒にいるだけで安心しちゃいますから♪","zh":"我很懂～！\n因为亚利沙也是，光是在一起就会感到安心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1449.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"c7b6861e4e90b7c04775c0b0fe4b3d2301769c8c61020c005c2f54d9088ad921","ja":"ここでもキャンペーンなの？　気持ちはうれしいけど、\nここにはファンの人はいないよ！？","zh":"在这里也要搞宣传活动吗？虽然心意很让人高兴，\n但这里可没有粉丝在哦！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
